# Ogemray 25A (Shelly app "Ogemray25", firmware 2.0.0), UART0 console at 115200 8N1
# Debug level 3, file logger OFF. Captured across a reboot triggered over RPC.
#
# Anonymised: MAC addresses (and the device id / hostnames derived from them), all IP addresses,
# client ids, Wi-Fi SSID, time zone, coordinates and production batch are replaced by <PLACEHOLDERS>.
# Lines carrying keys or tokens (cloud key, JWS, Wi-Fi credentials) are removed entirely, and RPC
# frame payloads are omitted.
#
# The running application's console is only partly readable on this hardware, most likely because
# eco mode changes the APB clock and shifts the effective baud. Garbled lines were dropped:
# 1239 lines captured, 1066 readable, 12 removed for carrying secrets, 1054 kept.

